\newlabel{tab:pygad_10x10_parameters}{{4.3}{59}{Extreme hyperparameter configuration required to embed a $10 \times 10$ QUBO instance. The parameters reveal a shift toward high population diversity combined with very delicate, fine-grained spatial mutations to prevent layout destruction in dense geometric conditions. All explicitly listed values highlight the necessary deviations from the initial $5 \times 5$ baseline established in Table \ref {tab:pygad_parameters_5x5}}{table.4.3}{}}
